<title>SWEDEN: Celsius appoints Lars Josefsson new head.</title>
<headline>Celsius appoints Lars Josefsson new head.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish defence and technology group Celsius said on Thursday that it had appointed Lars Josefsson as its new managing director, replacing Olle Lund who has headed the company for 13 years.</p>
</text>
